// Every frame is a full step -- input, the game's tick, drawing -- and only the
// last one survives into the PPM.
ed_shots(int n, int i) {
  while (i < n) {
    ed_step();
    i = i + 1;
  }
} return void;
given ed_t_boot stdin "" (3, 0):() then calls ed_step:[3]
given ed_t_boot stdin "" (0, 0):() then calls ed_step:[0]
